sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor TECH as Technician
    participant QI as Quality Inspector
    participant OR as Orchestrator (ADK)
    participant FS as Firestore incident board
    participant TRA as Traceability
    participant PA as Process Analyst
    participant KN as Knowledge
    participant RCA as Root Cause Agent
    participant RG as Repair Guide
    participant ADOC as Action & Documentation
    participant KC as Knowledge Capture

    QI->>FS: {event: defect_spike, type: scratch_vertical, rate: 0.077, since: 09:40}
    FS-->>OR: new signal on the board
    OR->>FS: {incident: INC-0412, status: tracing}

    Note over OR,TRA: Step 1 - sequential and mandatory
    OR->>TRA: link defective products to line data
    TRA->>FS: {suspects: [CNC-02/T07 0.95], excluded: [material_lot]}

    Note over OR,KN: Step 2 - run in parallel
    par Sensor analysis
        OR->>PA: pull CNC-02 data, 09:00-10:00
        PA->>FS: {finding: vibration +35%, current +12%, since: 09:30, confidence: 0.8}
    and Knowledge lookup
        OR->>KN: vertical scratch + CNC-02
        KN->>FS: {finding: tool wear, sources: [manual p.112, maint_log T07, 8D 2026-03-12]}
    end

    OR->>RCA: synthesize all evidence
    alt confidence >= 0.7
        RCA->>FS: {root_cause: T07 worn, over tool life, confidence: 0.87, whys, ishikawa}
    else confidence < 0.7
        RCA->>OR: {need: close-up photo of insert}
        OR->>RG: turn request into a question
        RG->>TECH: ask for close-up photo
        TECH-->>RG: photo
        RG->>FS: new evidence attached
        FS-->>RCA: re-run analysis
    end

    Note over OR,ADOC: Step 3 - resolution in parallel
    par Guide the repair
        OR->>RG: start voice session
        TECH->>RG: "What is wrong with this machine?"
        RG-->>TECH: step-by-step, each step cites the manual (Gemini Live)
    and Draft the paperwork
        OR->>ADOC: draft 8D and work order
        ADOC->>FS: {documents: [8D, work_order, SOP_proposal]}
    end
    TECH->>RG: repair done
    RG->>FS: {repair_done: true, steps_taken: [...]}

    Note over OR,QI: Step 4 - close only when the product confirms
    OR->>QI: verify 50 consecutive products
    QI->>FS: {verified: true, good_streak: 50, rate: 0.004}
    OR->>FS: {status: closed, pending_approval: shift_leader}

    OR->>KC: learn from the closed incident
    KC->>FS: {impact: {scrap_avoided: 240, downtime_min: 45, kwh: 38, co2_kg: 25}}
    KC->>KC: add entry to the defect-cause-fix library
